  m_Name: DilemmaConcessaoSaneamento
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::RandomEventData
  _title: "Concess\xE3o do saneamento"
  _description: "Investidores querem assumir a \xE1gua e o esgoto da cidade. O dinheiro
    aceleraria as obras, e o contrato pode priorizar a arrecada\xE7\xE3o da prefeitura
    ou o atendimento de quem ainda n\xE3o tem rede."
  _titleEn: Sanitation concession
  _descriptionEn: Investors want to take over the city water and sewage. The money
    would speed up the works, and the contract can favor City Hall revenue or service
    for those still off the network.
  _triggerConditions: []
  _statEffects: []
  _minTurn: 2
  _maxTurn: 17
  _choices:
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: -2
      - Parameter: 7
        Amount: 5
      - Parameter: 5
        Amount: 3
      FollowUpEventId: 
      FollowUpDelay: 0
    Label: "Concess\xE3o com metas e tarifa social"
    LabelEn: Concession with targets and social tariff
    Detail: Menos dinheiro na assinatura, mas o contrato cobra atendimento e protege
      quem pode pagar menos.
    DetailEn: Less money up front, but the contract demands service and protects
      those who can pay less.
  - Rule:
      Effects:
      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: 5
      - Parameter: 7
        Amount: 1
      FollowUpEventId: ConsequenciaSaneamentoTarifa
      FollowUpDelay: 3
    Label: "Concess\xE3o pelo maior lance"
    LabelEn: Concession to the highest bidder
    Detail: "O caixa da prefeitura enche agora. O contrato n\xE3o fala de quem est\xE1
      fora da rede."
    DetailEn: City Hall coffers fill up now. The contract says nothing about those
      off the network.
  - Rule:
