      - Parameter: 0
        Amount: -6
      - Parameter: 7
        Amount: 6
      - Parameter: 5
        Amount: 4
      FollowUpEventId: 
      FollowUpDelay: 0
    Label: "Manter p\xFAblico e investir"
    LabelEn: Keep it public and invest
    Detail: "A prefeitura banca a expans\xE3o com o pr\xF3prio caixa."
    DetailEn: City Hall pays for the expansion out of its own budget.
